L1: Benfotiamine Supplementation Increases Thiamine in Muscle of Endurance-Trained Mice and Affects the Energy Metabolism
L2: Journal of Nutrition and Metabolism (2024)
L3: Álisson C. Gonçalves, Jéssica F. Vieira, Ana Carolina N. Rodrigues, Eddie F. C. Murta, Júlio S. Marchini, Márcia A. Michelin, Guilherme V. Portari
L4: 1 
L5:  Department of Nutrition 
L6:  Federal Institute of Education, Science, and Technology Goiano , Campus Urutaí, Urutaí, GO, Brazil
L7: 2 
L8:  Oncology Research Institute 
L9:  Federal University of Triângulo Mineiro , Uberaba, MG, Brazil
L10: 3 
